  <collaboration id="Id_3ea86cdc-3aea-4ab4-b88f-fc7d2e261ece" name="P19. Produção da Obra">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da obra contemplando a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do avan&amp;ccedil;o f&amp;iacute;sico considerando a sinergia entre as atividades diversas dos munic&amp;iacute;pios e da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Lei de Licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e Contratos Administrativos com o Item 5.6- Produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o colaborativa da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e o Item 5.7 - Entrega do modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da ISO 19650-2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
